{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1250,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# Atria Dawn Preview — model  \nShanghai AI Lab, built on the **GLM-5.2** architecture (`GlmMoeDsaForCausalLM`, model_type `glm_moe_dsa`). One continuous decoder-only stack L0–77, read top → bottom; layers that repeat are drawn once with **×N**. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all one size. T = sequence length. *Layer* tab = one decoder layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1250,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "Layer rows — **blue**: dense SwiGLU FFN (12288) · **cyan**: MoE + its own DSA indexer · **plain**: MoE, reuses the indexer's top-2048 picks of the layer above (`indexer_types` = shared). Orange = whose top-k picks a layer uses. The barcode on the right lists every layer in order.    \nAll numbers from `config.json` + safetensors headers (59585 tensors, 753.33B params). Model card: \"744B MoE\", 256K context; `max_position_embeddings` = 1048576."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "tok2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -864,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**tokenizer** (vocab 154880)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ids3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 130,
   "y": -768,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
